{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:18 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n\n<p>練馬師文家良在第一場「籐王駒」贏馬後，接着在第二場以「紅海旺」勝出，率先起孖而回，「紅海旺」上周日開鑼戰在一千米直路賽跑第二，今日匆匆再岀，強配潘頓即贏馬補中。</p>\n<p>文家良以「籐王駒」和「紅海旺」起孖而回，後駒拉頭馬時，馬主邀請同場「電子好好」馬主團體成員盧偉國博士拉頭馬，盧博士今次一個人入場，其未婚妻余仲欣則未見入場。</p>\n<p>賽後手風甚順的文家良說：「潘頓騎『紅海旺』發揮出色，今場排六檔，潘頓騎來不心急，早段緊貼前領馬，最後三百米展開衝刺，騎法明智。『紅海旺』上場由黃寶妮騎，由於今場報名馬不多，廄侶『電子好好』加入此場賽事，後駒續由黃寶妮騎，而潘頓今場可以為『紅海旺』主轡。我會安排『紅海旺』小休，之後會主攻沙田一千米直路賽。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/72b750aa5c7c8cfb5e6dd43966caa3c7/2026-09/39b601ec-2758-4202-b8d3-eba61534e002.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5c97e46b883ff5c59f0adc318cd6cd4f/2026-09/77c52248-3a87-4455-a80b-daff8708e937.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/65e6ed340ce7d4621ed9d6d6d3d4f52d/2026-09/2424b852-7ef9-42c7-becf-11aa4d24a1e3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bacbe30c989aea83acaeea7535935fad/2026-09/77798af1-2062-4b14-a9fa-16b4d957a3a4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87d795b93e861348eb0c152cfe0dd57b/2026-09/02395354-3a43-441c-9a99-bef7823d62a2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/487b1bcaae9ec9067cbf8f6d62b35a2a/2026-09/a2b69732-5212-4c3d-a5bb-00141a7e1d58.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/37b50ae7fceca02a6e759cf38af0bbc4/2026-09/c283de0c-7bbd-4cd5-a02a-8a0fede69a9f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/04e74822b06d1a4fcd8465af325bc10b/2026-09/cdd4e024-9c93-4223-8051-2e23706d6249.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e62bfe98f4b265b2876bf4c573957c7b/2026-09/d9d16748-f663-4dbd-8cd2-f24ab26b2605.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0894a769aaa1ebe07c815956900951b8/2026-09/dd2ba0b4-00ea-42d5-b6a0-09e5f787c675.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e2a13cc5b7e8503e281e99a48d6fbc46/2026-09/f9e95530-f06f-4771-a978-01b64d09f7c3.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T06:38:35.100184+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}